EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey, it's you, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Visiting TODAY? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}But how?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
How did you...?
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Wow, I could barely roll out of
bed this morning. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}I guess I need the
sun to fire up MY mojo.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ehi, ma sei tu, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Che ci fai qui proprio oggi? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Dico...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Come hai fatto a...?
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Sei eccezionale, per me è stata una
tragedia uscire dal letto stamattina.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Senza sole non mi accendo!

Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}ma guarda {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}che brav{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Tutt{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
pimpante in un giorno così oscuro?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I miei complimenti, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Il mio cervello, lo sai, non è niente
male, ma nel giorno del solstizio
d'inverno si rifiuta di collaborare!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Good morning, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Guess I made the right decision.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I almost stayed in bed this morning!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}The sun is hibernating today, after
all. Glad I didn't sleep in, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}or else I'd
have missed YOU, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hey, good to see you, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Pretty weird atmosphere today,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
don't you think, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Kinda goth? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Sorta noir? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Whatever
you call it, this day-is-night vibe
should make things interesting.

IT:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hola, che piacere, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Che atmosfera strana oggi, non ti
pare? {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Un giorno gotico? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}O forse noir?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Comunque tu voglia chiamarlo, a
me pare un giorno da veri duri!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Think the day's kinda cold?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
you haven't felt nothing yet...
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Actually, if it keeps getting colder,
that may be pretty accurate. {{TAG:0003:0024:}}You
won't be able to feel a thing!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehilà, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non c'è da stupirsi che oggi
pomeriggio faccia così freddo.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Beh, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}dopo un giorno intero di buio,
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}stanotte farà frío. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Non fare quella
faccia, è divertente, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hace buena noche, ¿eh, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aunque parece un pelín más oscura
de lo normal{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Che bella notte, eh, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sembra più buio del solito, chissà
perché?! Ma niente paura...
Nessuna notte dura in eterno.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Spassiamocela, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}come to visit {{TAG:0005:0005:}} in
the middle of the night, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
On such a COLD night too.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ehi, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}ma che fai qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
nel cuore della notte, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Brrr! Cerca di non prendere freddo!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}du kommst mitten in der Nacht
nach {{TAG:0005:0005:}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und ausgerechnet bei dieser Kälte?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Buenas noches, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hace frío, aunque a mí me gusta
porque me despeja los pulmones.
